	(text "REINS guitar board for JLCPCB. Same outline, holes, OLED, encoder, button and USB-C position as the milled board.\nBattery: J2 -> switch on J5 -> VBAT_SW -> wire from TP1 to XIAO BAT+. D0 reads half of VBAT_SW.\nLED ring supply: USB 5 V or the battery through D1 and D2, so the ring also lights on battery."
